== High-level Checklist ==
{{CheckboxList}}
* '''Obtain [[Chapter I, The Shatter Sky]]'''
:* Run to Permafrost. On the way kill any Mammoths and Goblins you see in Everfrost (for the next step’s items). Run to King Thex'Ka IV’s spawn point @POS 680, NEG281 (spot 3 on the map). Say “Aurilias, I remember” to get a [[Permafrost Resonance Crystal]].
:* Go to Thurgadin, and go behind the statue directly across from Icewell @NEG200, 0 and say “Aurilias, I remember” to get a [[Thurgadin Resonance Crystal]].
:* Go to the Dreadlands and head for the Yeti Caves (#1 on the map @POS2098, POS5050). At the intersection inside the caves (only one crossroads), say “Aurilias, I remember” to get a [[Dreadlands Resonance Crystal]].
:* Go to Everfrost. Run to [[Watcher Aenwen]] @POS 3100, POS750. Hand in the THREE RESONANCE CRYSTALS to receive CHAPTER I and a Holiday Gift. Use up this Gift.

*'''Obtain [[Chapter II, Of Bards and Bitter Winters]]'''
:* Go to Iceclad and tell [[Archivist Tyriele]] @POS4645, POS1930 "I will find who this belonged to." to get your [[Lost Gift Box]].
:* Go to Thurgadin. Go to the bar in northeast Thurgadin and hand in your [[Lost Gift Box]] to [[Kirvil Snowstring]] @POS110, NEG425 to get a [[Discarded Packaging]].
:* Return to [[Archivist Tyriele]] in Iceclad @POS4645, POS1930 and hand in your [[Discarded Packaging]] to get CHAPTER II and holiday gift. Use up this gift.

*'''Obtain [[Chapter III, When Stars Forget Their Light]]'''
:*Go to TOFS and get the 4 LOST PAGES:
::*[[Forgotten Page 1]] - Skeletons on floor 1 & 3.
::*[[Forgotten Page 2]] - Any ghost on floor 2.
::*[[Forgotten Page 3]] - Only the Armored Shadows and Zombies on floor 3 (Confirmed Narmak Berreka on Floor 4 dropped page 3).
::*[[Forgotten Page 4]] - From any on floor 4.
:* Go to Great Divide and turn in your 4 LOST PAGES to [[Windscribe Thaloria]] @NEG1950, NEG2650 and receive CHAPTER III and a holiday gift. Use up your gift

*'''Obtain [[Chapter IV, Of Flame and Frost]]'''
:* [[Frostbitten Hide]] - Mammoths in Everfrost.
:* [[Emberberry Cluster]] - Goblins in Sol A.
:* [[Dew of First Light]] - [[Will O Wisp]] in North Karana (or anywhere you want for this, really).
:* Return to DL. Run to [[Frosti Bramblebrew]] @POS 725, POS 6700. Turn in your hide, cluster, and dew, to receive CHAPTER IV and a Holiday Gift. Use up this Gift.

*'''Obtain [[Chapter V, Ashes in the Margins]]'''
:* Run to EW. Tell [[Isolde Winterveil]] at @NEG4500, NEG4400 "I will take this shard." to get your [[Frosted Memory Shard]].
:* Go to Qeynos Hills. Find [[Guard Lammel]]. He walks from Surefall to Qeynos along the path. Give him your [[Frosted Memory Shard]] and receive a [[Frosted Broach]].
:* Port to Iceclad and run to Eastern Wastes. Go to [[Isolde Winterveil]] @NEG4500, NEG4400. Give her the [[Frosted Broach]] to receive CHAPTER V and a HOLIDAY GIFT. Keep this gift for chapter six.

*'''Obtain [[Chapter VI, The First Frost]]'''
:* [[Goblin Ice Necklace]] - any goblin in Everfrost Peaks.
:* [[Fire Goblin Skin]] - any goblin in Solusek's Eye
:* [[Holiday Gift]] from any turn in. Must be unopened.
:* Go to EW. Run to [[Dreamspeaker Lyssiara]] @NEG4140, NEG2490. Give her your necklace, skin, and gift, to receive CHAPTER VI and a gift.
<br/><strong>NOTE: do NOT have the [[Zombie Flesh Bracer]] on your person when you do the turn in or the turn in will fail</strong>.
*'''The Final Steps'''
:* Make sure you don't have the first reward anywhere in your inventory.
:* Go to a loom (or use a sewing kit) to sew up all SIX CHAPTERS.
:* Go to the EC tunnel. Find [[Scholar Darnath]], who is by Shady. Hand in your [[Whispers of the Icestar]] to receive your reward! You can turn in until you receive the desired item. 
<br/><strong>NOTE: do NOT have the [[Zombie Flesh Bracer]] on your person when you do the turn in or the turn in will fail</strong>.
